olor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-gray-400"><path d="M8.25 4.5l7.5 7.5-7.5 7.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><a class="min-w-0 truncate whitespace-nowrap text-nowrap hover:text-gray-700 hover:underline font-semibold" href="/public-notices">Public Notices</a></div></div></div></div></div><section class="w-full"><div class="@container w-full"><div class="mx-auto w-full @5xl:max-w-256 @7xl:max-w-360 @min-[96rem]:max-w-400 px-4 @5xl:px-[5%] @7xl:px-20 @min-[96rem]:px-24 grid grid-cols-1 @5xl:pt-20 pt-10"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-5"><h1 class="break-words font-semibold font-serif @5xl:text-[60px] text-[48px] text-gray-700 @5xl:leading-15 leading-12">Public Notices</h1><div class="max-w-3xl content-flow"><p>Official notices from the Utah County Clerk&#x27;s Office, including election notices, notices of public test, and post-election audit notices. Reminders also go out on<!-- --> <a class="font-semibold text-UC-blue-600 hover:underline rounded-sm focus-visible:underline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-UC-blue-600 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 active:text-UC-purple-500 @3xl:hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.facebook.com/UtahCoElections/">Facebook</a>.</p></div></div></div></div></section></div></div><section class="w-full bg-white"><div class="@container w-full"><div class="mx-auto w-full @5xl:max-w-256 @7xl:max-w-360 @min-[96rem]:max-w-400 px-4 @5xl:px-[5%] @7xl:px-20 @min-[96rem]:px-24 @3xl:pb-16 pb-10 grid grid-cols-1 pt-8"><div><div class="w-50"><div class="flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col gap-2" data-headlessui-state=""><label class="font-medium font-sans text-base text-gray-700 leading-6 data-disabled:text-gray-500" id="headlessui-label-_R_mtbsnlivb_" for="headlessui-control-_R_tbsnlivb_" data-headlessui-state="">Filter by year</label><button class="group flex h-12 w-full items-center justify-between gap-2 rounded-[4px] bg-white px-3 text-left font-sans text-base leading-6 text-gray-700 outline-none ring-1 ring-inset transition-shadow data-open:ring-2 data-open:ring-UC-blue-400 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:bg-gray-100 disabled:text-gray-500 disabled:ring-gray-300 disabled:hover:ring-gray-300 ring-gray-400 hover:ring-gray-700 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-UC-blue-400" id="headlessui-control-_R_tbsnlivb_" type="button" aria-haspopup="listbox" aria-expanded="false" data-headlessui-state=""><span class="truncate">All years</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" class="size-4 shrink-0 text-gray-500 transition-transform duration-200 group-data-open:rotate-180" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M480-344 240-584l56-56 184 184 184-184 56 56-240 240Z"></path></svg></button><span hidden="" style="position:fixed;top:1px;left:1px;width:1px;height:0;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0, 0, 0, 0);white-space:nowrap;border-width:0;display:none"></span></div></div><div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-10"><article id="notice-682" class="flex flex-col @3xl:gap-10 gap-4.5"><hr class="border-0 border-t border-gray-400"/><div><h2 class="font-semibold text-gray-700 text-xl leading-7">November 4, 2026 Board of Commissioners of Utah County, Utah Public Meeting</h2><p class="mt-1 text-gray-500 text-sm leading-5">November 2, 2026</p><div class="mt-3 max-w-prose break-words content-flow"><p><a href="https://agenda.utahcounty.gov/agenda?id=1902" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Agenda with Documents<span class="sr-only"> about November 4, 2026 Board of Commissioners of Utah County, Utah Public Meeting (opens in a new tab)</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" class="size-5 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M180-120q-24 0-42-18t-18-42v-600q0-24 18-42t42-18h279v60H180v600h600v-279h60v279q0 24-18 42t-42 18H180Zm202-219-42-43 398-398H519v-60h321v321h-60v-218L382-339Z"></path></svg></a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.utahcounty.gov/api/media/file/main-commission-agenda-2026-11-04.pdf" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Agenda<span class="sr-only"> about November 4, 2026 Board of Commissioners of Utah County, Utah Public Meeting (opens in a new tab)</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" class="size-5 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M180-120q-24 0-42-18t-18-42v-600q0-24 18-42t42-18h279v60H180v600h600v-279h60v279q0 24-18 42t-42 18H180Zm202-219-42-43 398-398H519v-60h321v321h-60v-218L382-339Z"></path></svg></a></p></div></div></article><article id="notice-681" class="flex flex-col @3xl:gap-10 gap-4.5"><hr class="border-0 border-t border-gray-400"/><div><h2 class="font-semibold text-gray-700 text-xl leading-7">Utah County Halloween 2026</h2><p class="mt-1 text-gray-500 text-sm leading-5">October 30, 2026</p><div class="mt-3 max-w-prose break-words content-flow"><p>Halloween at Utah County included lions, witches, pumpkins and super mario.  You had toy story, wicked and even cholera costumes.  So much fun and lots of creative costumes.  Happy Halloween!</p></div></div></article><article id="notice-680" class="flex flex-col @3xl:gap-10 gap-4.5"><hr class="border-0 border-t border-gray-400"/><div><h2 class="font-semibold text-gray-700 text-xl leading-7">November 3, 2026 at 1 pm -  Board of Commissioners of Utah County, UT Budget Work Session</h2><p class="mt-1 text-gray-500 text-sm leading-5">October 30, 2026</p><div class="mt-3 max-w-prose break-words content-flow"><p>WORK SESSION</p>
<ol>
<li>WORK SESSION REGARDING THE 2027 UTAH COUNTY BUDGET FOR THE GENERAL FUND AND OTHER BUDGETARY FUNDS OF UTAH COUNTY, UTAH.
-Aileen Conder, Commission</li>
</ol></div></div></article><article id="notice-679" class="flex flex-col @3xl:gap-10 gap-4.5"><hr class="border-0 border-t border-gray-400"/><div><h2 class="font-semibold text-gray-700 text-xl leading-7">November 3, 2026 at 10 am -  Board of Commissioners of Utah County, UT Budget Work Session</h2><p class="mt-1 text-gray-500 text-sm leading-5">October 30, 2026</p><div class="mt-3 max-w-prose break-words content-flow"><p>WORK SESSION</p>
<ol>
<li>WORK SESSION REGARDING THE 2027 UTAH COUNTY BUDGET FOR THE GENERAL FUND AND OTHER BUDGETARY FUNDS OF UTAH COUNTY, UTAH.
-Aileen Conder, Commission</li>
</ol></div></div></article><article id="notice-678" class="flex flex-col @3xl:gap-10 gap-4.5"><hr class="border-0 border-t border-gray-400"/><div><h2 class="font-semibold text-gray-700 text-xl leading-7">IRONMAN triathlon coming to Utah County in 2027 </h2><p class="mt-1 text-gray-500 text-sm leading-5">October 27, 2026</p><div class="mt-3 max-w-prose break-words content-flow"><p>Utah County - An IRONMAN triathlon is scheduled to come to Utah County on Aug. 21, 2027, bringing competitors and visitors to the valley for a course through the mountains and canyon.  It will begin with a swim in Deer Creek, continue with a bike ride through Provo Canyon and finish in Orem, Utah County Commissioner Skyler Beltran said.</p>
<p>“This is a big deal because we have made a deliberate effort to make this the sports premier capital,” Beltran said. He called IRONMAN one of the best-known triathlon brands in the country and internationally.</p>
<p>The event is expected to draw thousands of competitors, along with their families and friends. Visitors will have a chance to take in the area’s mountain scenery and experience local hospitality.</p></div></div></article><article id="notice-677" class="flex flex-col @3xl:gap-10 gap-4.5"><hr class="border-0 border-t border-gray-400"/><div><h2 class="font-semibold text-gray-700 text-xl leading-7">November 18, 2026 Board of Trustees of Utah County Service Area No 9 Notice of Public Hearing</h2><p class="mt-1 text-gray-500 text-sm leading-5">October 27, 2026</p><div class="mt-3 max-w-prose break-words content-flow"><p><a href="/api/media/file/notice-2026-840.pdf" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View Notice<span class="sr-only"> about November 18, 2026 Board of Trustees of Utah County Service Area No 9 Notice of Public Hearing (opens in a new tab)</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" class="size-5 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M180-120q-24 0-42-18t-18-42v-600q0-24 18-42t42-18h279v60H180v600h600v-279h60v279q0 24-18 42t-42 18H180Zm202-219-42-43 398-398H519v-60h321v321h-60v-218L382-339Z"></path></svg></a></p></div></div></article><article id="notice-674" class="flex flex-col @3xl:gap-10 gap-4.5"><hr class="border-0 border-t border-gray-400"/><div><h2 class="font-semibold text-gray-700 text-xl leading-7">November 18, 2026 Board of Trustees of Utah County Service Area No 8 Notice of Public Hearing</h2><p class="mt-1 text-gray-500 text-sm leading-5">October 27, 2026</p><div class="mt-3 max-w-prose break-words content-flow"><p><a href="/api/media/file/Notice-2026-838-SA-No-8.pdf" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View Notice<span class="sr-only"> about November 18, 2026 Board of Trustees of Utah County Service Area No 8 Notice of Public Hearing (opens in a new tab)</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="