Regular meetings of the Board of County Commissioners of Utah County, Utah, will be held during 2026 at the county seat of Utah County on the dates as set forth below. All regular meetings of the Board of County Commissioners of Utah County, Utah will be held in Room 1400 of the Utah County Administration Building, 100 East Center Street, Provo, Utah, unless otherwise changed by action of a quorum of the Board of County Commissioners of Utah County, Utah. </p></div></article><article id="notice-491" class="flex flex-col @3xl:gap-10 gap-4.5"><hr class="border-0 border-t border-gray-400"/><div><h2 class="font-semibold text-gray-700 text-xl leading-7">Notice of Adoption of Community Reinvestment Project Area Plan</h2><p class="mt-1 text-gray-500 text-sm leading-5">December 23, 2025</p><p class="mt-3 max-w-prose text-base text-gray-700">NOTICE OF ADOPTION OF COMMUNITY REINVESTMENT PROJECT AREA PLAN FINAL QUICKSILVER SOLAR COMMUNITY REINVESTMENT PROJECT AREA PLAN</p></div></article><article id="notice-490" class="flex flex-col @3xl:gap-10 gap-4.5"><hr class="border-0 border-t border-gray-400"/><div><h2 class="font-semibold text-gray-700 text-xl leading-7">2026 Notice of Regular Meeting Schedule for the Board of County Commissioners of Utah County, Utah</h2><p class="mt-1 text-gray-500 text-sm leading-5">December 22, 2025</p><p class="mt-3 max-w-prose text-base text-gray-700">Regular meetings of the Board of County Commissioners of Utah County, Utah, will be held during 2026 at the county seat of Utah County on the dates as set forth below. All regular meetings of the Board of County Commissioners of Utah County, Utah will be held in room 1400 of the Utah County Administration Building, 100 East Center Street, Provo, Utah, unless otherwise changed by action of a quorum of the Board of County Commissioners of Utah County, Utah.</p></div></article><article id="notice-484" class="flex flex-col @3xl:gap-10 gap-4.5"><hr class="border-0 border-t border-gray-400"/><div><h2 class